type: software
title: "norm-arith: A Lean tactic for norm estimates"
authors:
  - family-names: Ortega
    given-names: Tomas
repository-code: "https://github.com/TomasOrtega/norm-arith"
url: "https://github.com/TomasOrtega/norm-arith"
version: "0.1.0"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A Lean tactic for norm estimates whose useful vector decomposition is hidden.
  Search proposes rational coefficients; Lean checks the vector identity and
  norm certificate before exact scalar arithmetic closes the goal.
keywords:
  - Lean
  - formal verification
  - norm arithmetic
